    "title": "「Melting White」正式上架",
    "cate": 1,
    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#999999\">她经过窗前，拭擦玻璃的雾气，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">她漫步小径，触碰地面的积雪。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">睡梦与砂糖溶解，时光和纯白融化，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">《Melting White》，保存下行将消逝的碎片，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">Huwahuwahu,</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#999999\">Talking in the sleep.</span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"8a637bd1197a4d2e1bc24f66d761ee50\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20211224/8a637bd1197a4d2e1bc24f66d761ee50.png\"/></div><p></p>",
    "date": "2021-12-24"
  }
